Operator-decided 2026-09-27. Role LABELS swap over two unchanged processes; the
coder_escalation / ingest_long_context aliases stay on the :8083 27B (operator
ruling) and are re-pointed explicitly to its new host label architect_critic.

- Binding follows the process: stack_topology numa_config, launch_manifest
  port_map / hot list / role_launch_meta, stack_templates (alias_to:
  architect_critic), stack_env blocks + arch_aliases, URL fallback and
  runtime-selected alias tables (models.py, health.py), dashboard GPU set,
  eval_tower GPU lanes + GPU judge default, kv_compress layer rows, autopilot /
  prewarmer ports, seeding reload map, role_restart.architect_* knobs,
  factual_risk tiers, host-role lists.
- src/roles.py: escalation now ends at architect_general (Flash-Next) —
  coder_escalation / thinking_reasoning / architect_critic -> architect_general;
  fallback worker_math -> [critic], ingest -> [general] (no same-fleet edges).
- Graph paths (nodes.py ArchitectNode, chat_delegation) unchanged: they target
  ARCHITECT_GENERAL by name and so reach Flash-Next. RI-21 deliberately open.
- Tests updated for the new bindings.

